一段高质量的中文提示词。\n\n请严格遵守以下逻辑：\n\n1.  **主体判定与描述（至关重要）**：\n    * **若画面是建筑/空间**：详细描述建筑风格（如哥特式、现代主义）、内部结构（如拱顶、梁柱）、材质（石材、木质、金属）及空间透视感。**严禁在描述中虚构不存在的人物。**\n    * **若画面是静物/产品**：聚焦于物体的材质光泽、纹理细节、颜色搭配及摆放形态。\n    * **若画面包含人物**：才需要描述人物的性别、服饰、发型及动作。**如果画面无人，请直接跳过此项，不要编造。**\n\n2.  **环境与光影**：\n    * 描述光源来源（自然光、人造灯光、丁达尔光束）、光影的明暗对比、色调氛围（庄重、神秘、明亮）。\n\n3.  **构图与视角**：\n    * 描述镜头语言（如对称构图、广角仰视、微距特写、景深虚化）。\n\n**输出要求**：\n* 输出一段连贯的中文自然语言，不要分点。\n* **若原图中没有人物，描述中绝不能出现“男人、女人、行人”等词汇。**\n* 字数控制在500字以内。\n中文提示词，不要出现对图像水印的描述，不要出现无关的文字和符号，不需要总结，", "Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct", "none", false, 0.7, 2048, 200704, 1003520, 214, "fixed", "sdpa"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "source_path", "label": "source_path", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "source_path"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 2950, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_new_tokens"}, "name": "max_new_tokens", "label": "max_new_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_new_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "min_pixels"}, "name": "min_pixels", "label": "min_pixels", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "min_pixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_pixels"}, "name": "max_pixels", "label": "max_pixels", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_pixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": 